  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{SO}_{4}$ saturated with $\\mathrm{SO}_{3}$ is called oleum of sulphan.\r\n$$\r\n\\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{SO}_{4}+\\mathrm{SO}_{3} \\longrightarrow \\mathrm{H}_{2} \\mathrm{S}_{2} \\mathrm{O}_{7}\r\n$$"
